section.tag-filter aria-label="絞り込み中のタグ"
  span.tag-filter__label タグで絞り込み中
  ul.tag-filter__selected-tags
    - selected_tags.each do |tag_name|
      li
        = link_to tag_deselect_path(tag_name, current_selected_tags: selected_tags),
          class: "tag-filter__selected-tag" do
          = "##{tag_name}"
          span.tag-filter__remove ×
  button.tag-filter__add-mode type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-tag-mode-target="toggle" data-action="tag-mode#toggle" さらにタグを追加して絞り込む
  = link_to "タグの絞り込みをクリア", reference_archives_path, class: "tag-filter__clear", data: { action: "tag-mode#reset" }
